  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Add an option to world settings to override Forced/Dynamic Near Distance while a player is in that world. This will allow users of that setting to not have to change their settings when they go to worlds with sight lines or distances larger than 1km.\n\nSince becoming a persistent setting, this has resulted in a lot of issues with players being suddenly unable to access UI or even their own menus, sometimes even at relatively short distances to origin (observed around 200m). \n\nThe simplest solution to this is to just have an override setting in world settings so players can “set and forget” and worlds with exact ref camera clip settings can be viewed correctly.",
